title: GiftStall
---
Old Garrick leans over his stall, eyes twinkling. #line:gift_000
Old Garrick: A birthday, is it? Well, your coin buys any one of these. #line:gift_001
-> A paper twist of honey sweets. #line:gift_opt_sweets
    <<set_label gift sweets>>
    <<take_item coin>>
    <<take_item coin>>
    <<give_item honey sweets>>
    <<emote trader laugh>>
    Old Garrick: Sweets for the sweet. #line:gift_ack_sweets
    He wraps them tight in brown paper. #line:gift_ack_sweets_2
-> A ribbon the colour of cornflowers. #line:gift_opt_ribbon
    <<set_label gift ribbon>>
    <<take_item coin>>
    <<take_item coin>>
    <<give_item cornflower ribbon>>
    Old Garrick: She'll wear that till it's rags. #line:gift_ack_ribbon
    He folds it neatly into your palm. #line:gift_ack_ribbon_2
-> A little wooden bird, carved by hand. #line:gift_opt_bird
    <<set_label gift carved_bird>>
    <<take_item coin>>
    <<take_item coin>>
    <<give_item carved wooden bird>>
    <<emote trader bow>>
    Old Garrick: Took me a week, that one. It'll last her a lifetime. #line:gift_ack_bird
===
